sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant CV as ChatView (Swift)
    participant RS as RecognizeService (Swift)
    participant RF as recognize 云函数
    participant AL as AgentLoop
    participant SN as SenseNova
    participant AT as AgentTools
    participant CB as CloudBase(aia_records)

    U->>CV: 输入问题 t
    Note over CV: isQuestionLike(t)==true 路由
    CV->>RS: chat(text:t, context:摘要)
    RS->>RF: POST {mode:"agent", userId, text, context, provider:"sensenovaText"}

    RF->>AL: handleAgent(body)
    AL->>SN: callWithTools(system+context+text, tools[])

    alt 模型返回 tool_calls（正常分支）
        SN-->>AL: tool_calls=[query_bills(...), get_summary(...)]
        loop 每个 tool_call（最多 5 轮）
            AL->>AT: query_bills(args)
            AT->>CB: where(userId,type,time范围,deleted:false).get()  [只读]
            CB-->>AT: records
            AT-->>AL: {code,data,message}
            AL->>SN: 回填 tool 结果(role:tool) + 再 callWithTools
        end
        SN-->>AL: 最终 reply（无 tool_calls）
        AL-->>RF: {ok:true, reply, toolsUsed}
    else 无 tool_calls / 不支持 tools / 无 userId / DB失败（降级分支）
        AL->>RF: 触发 degrade()
        RF->>SN: handleChat(context-only) 复用现有逻辑
        SN-->>RF: reply
    end

    RF-->>RS: {ok:true, reply}
    RS-->>CV: reply 字符串
    CV-->>U: 显示回复
